## Tests

The tests run the application over HTTP against the `{{project.module}}_test` database (docker compose creates it;
`TEST_DB_URL` points elsewhere).

{{#if (eq language "java")}}
```sh
./mvnw test
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "node")}}
```sh
npm test
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "python")}}
```sh
uv run pytest
```
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
{{#if extra.dockerfile}}

## Docker image

{{#if (eq language "java")}}
```sh
docker build --secret id=maven-settings,src=$HOME/.m2/settings.xml -t {{project.artifact}} .
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "node")}}
```sh
docker build --secret id=github-token,env=GITHUB_TOKEN -t {{project.artifact}} .
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq language "python")}}
```sh
python scripts/get_wheels.py && docker build -t {{project.artifact}} .
```
{{/if}}

Every instance must share one `keys` volume, and the first start must finish before a second instance starts: it is
the one that creates the keys.
{{/if}}
